n. refactor assert prong of test system to scenario based fluid api style
    [ ] 'assert_classes.py'
        - declare Scenario(ABC)
        - let all public methods of assert classes receive a fresh Scenario in param
        - use fluid api to build it in method
        - then return it to baseclass
    [ ] 'base_classes.py'
        - declare ScenarioImpl(Scenario)
        - when iterating over self public members, instantiate and pass a scenario
        - collect scenarios, then handle them somehow, producing a report.
    [ ] Frames
        - a frame is a snapshot of all things observable following an event.
'''
class ExecutionFrame:
    exit_code: Optional[int] = None     
    stdout: Optional[str] = None        
    stderr: Optional[str] = None        
    latest_write: Optional[str] = None  
    latest_clipboard: Optional[str] = None 
    latest_input: Optional[str] = None  
    disk_paths: list[Path] = field(default_factory=list) 
'''
